t 11, she must be kind.\n\nSo, Erin is kind. Therefore, the statement \"Erin is not kind\" is false. So the correct answer is B) False.\n\nI don't think I missed any steps. All the conditions lead to Erin being kind. So, the answer should be B.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"Erin is not kind\" is false because Erin meets the conditions to be kind. \n\n**Answer: B) False**",
